      "message": "feat(motion): widen a 4-axis wire cut per ruling, uniform as a stated choice\n\nEach ruling end takes the widening its own twist and lean need. The\nruled kerf law certifies the emitted wire at every height read. A\ntransition ruling one millimetre in from each end of a long span ends\na corner's widening; idle transitions are dropped again.\n\nRefs #1170\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
