      "message": "feat(sim): a stated verify tolerance for the wire kerf law\n\nThe kerf law passes a reading that enters the facets by no more than\nthe stated tolerance and says the deepest one. A deeper reading is a\ngouge that names the tolerance. The threading and slug laws stay strict.\n\nRefs #1170\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
